{"id": "housing-subsidy-placement-delays", "title": "Housing placements took 281 days against a 75-day target", "seconds": 59.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "f016819df235a482", "words": 163, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "A rental subsidy needs a landlord and a unit before someone can move in.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.7, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "prior", "kicker": "Rental subsidies", "text": "Rental units", "mark": "private market"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.44, 0.88, 1.11, 1.21, 1.66, 1.77, 1.93, 2.2, 2.53, 2.85, 3.03, 3.27]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Brilliant Corners had a 75-day housing placement target.", "t0": 3.82, "t1": 6.81, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "75 days", "label": "Average time to obtain housing"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.39, 0.82, 0.98, 1.08, 1.9, 2.26, 2.67]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The program served up to 500 adults. Other agencies provided case management.", "t0": 6.93, "t1": 11.9, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "continuity", "kicker": "Program capacity", "text": "500 adults", "mark": "subsidy administration"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.58, 0.88, 1.03, 1.22, 1.56, 1.86, 3.0, 3.3, 3.81, 4.24, 4.53]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The latest monitoring put the average wait at 281 days.", "t0": 12.02, "t1": 15.74, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "281 days", "label": "Average at Brilliant Corners"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.57, 1.02, 1.17, 1.31, 1.73, 2.06, 2.21, 2.45, 2.76, 3.23]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Only one of nine providers met the target. The overall average was 179 days.", "t0": 15.86, "t1": 21.43, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "179 days", "label": "Across the subsidy pool"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.52, 0.63, 0.9, 1.43, 1.6, 1.72, 2.74, 2.94, 3.36, 3.75, 3.94, 4.1, 4.46, 5.06]}, {"scene": "h", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "Brilliant Corners reported that 97 percent of referred clients moved into housing.", "t0": 21.65, "t1": 26.12, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "97%", "label": "Successful move-ins"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.76, 1.15, 1.31, 1.86, 2.24, 2.35, 2.71, 3.24, 3.54, 3.74]}, {"scene": "h", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The provider combined its search and placement teams and retrained staff.", "t0": 26.24, "t1": 29.76, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "next", "kicker": "Provider response", "text": "Housing search and placement teams", "mark": "page 32"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.58, 1.01, 1.17, 1.47, 1.58, 1.98, 2.35, 2.54, 3.01]}, {"scene": "h", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Monitoring also found the program overstated utility allowances to landlords.", "t0": 29.88, "t1": 34.42, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "next", "kicker": "Monitoring findings", "text": "Utility allowance calculations", "mark": "page 32"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.66, 1.03, 1.27, 1.38, 1.9, 2.54, 3.0, 3.49, 3.64]}, {"scene": "h", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The department was not seeking repayment. The report gave no dollar total.", "t0": 34.54, "t1": 38.59, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "next", "kicker": "Agency response", "text": "No repayment pursued", "mark": "page 32"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.6, 0.75, 0.94, 1.33, 2.38, 2.56, 2.92, 3.15, 3.35, 3.7]}, {"scene": "h", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The separate $2.7 million figure was unspent budget.", "t0": 38.71, "t1": 42.62, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$2.7 million", "label": "Budget underspending"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.57, 0.85, 1.17, 1.5, 1.83, 2.15, 2.56, 2.83, 3.36]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "In November, 437 participants were housed and 42 households were searching.", "t0": 42.84, "t1": 48.25, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "437 housed", "label": "42 households searching"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 1.0, 1.27, 1.54, 2.11, 2.65, 2.8, 3.5, 3.81, 4.31, 4.8, 4.96]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "Analysts warned that ending the contract without a replacement could jeopardize their subsidies.", "t0": 48.37, "t1": 52.87, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "next", "kicker": "Policy consideration", "text": "Continued rental subsidies", "mark": "page 34"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.8, 1.05, 1.37, 1.49, 1.95, 2.24, 2.33, 2.93, 3.17, 3.68, 3.86]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The proposed grant extension still awaited a Board decision.", "t0": 52.99, "t1": 55.9, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "docket", "kicker": "File 261211", "text": "Committee review", "mark": "November 27"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.57, 0.9, 1.43, 1.71, 2.05, 2.13, 2.43]}, {"scene": "r", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 56.02, "t1": 58.39, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.72, 0.94, 1.27, 1.38, 1.49, 1.76, 2.01]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The time to move in", "h": "What monitoring found", "r": "The people already housed"}, "look": "midnight", "hook": "document"}